  "reason": "Member is eligible under an active PPO Gold plan with no waiting period, the provider is in-network and in good standing, the imaging benefit has sufficient remaining balance, no existing authorization conflicts, and the diagnosis (M54.16) supports the requested MRI lumbar spine. Clinical documentation meets all four required criteria under MP-IMG-001: an 8-week trial of supervised physical therapy plus NSAID/muscle relaxant therapy without improvement (Criterion 1), objective neurologic findings including asymmetric reflex, dermatomal sensory loss, motor weakness, and positive straight leg raise (Criterion 2), recent plain radiographs demonstrating L4-L5 disc space narrowing (Criterion 3), and a clear impact on management via pending neurosurgical consultation to determine candidacy for surgical decompression (Criterion 4). The request is therefore approved.",
